      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "恐怕曾经持续驱动着我的那份动力，\n从一开始就是无可替代的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc948923f145ce150343d2a5b2b4b9a5c6358143e9f2e76bd510e9732baee0fe",
