      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489847c9010fa37726deb97a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "画面中接连映出\n世界各地的所有比赛场――",
      "source_fingerprint": "31129452e9920eee6e3cb318ce204333362ea3ff870181349de93806cf2cfcf9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:966c1fbf3d6fffe2a55ef206",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无一例外，都点亮了散发着柔和光芒的提灯，\n无数淡淡的橙色光辉在闪烁着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db74cbdfaab73a92ef70820bad61e2183c3769e8996638158f784e4442567d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
